    "notes": "Three sessions, all Van Gelder Studio Hackensack: 1955-08-01 (The Gig, House Party Starting, Chit-Chatting, Lady Sings the Blues, Hangover Triangle), 1955-08-07 (Terpsichore), 1956-04-19 (The Spinning Song, Query, Wildflower, Mine). Session dates and personnel per JazzDiscography.com (S2), corroborated by Wikipedia (S1). Producer Alfred Lion and engineer Rudy Van Gelder per Wikipedia technical personnel (S1). 'The Spinning Song' titled 'Spinning Song' in the Wikipedia track list; jazzdisco lists 'The Spinning Song' \u2014 Wikipedia title retained for the LP."
